sequenceDiagram
  participant F as Front signal scope
  participant R as Runner
  participant C as Managed child
  participant A as Shielded readers
  Note over F,A: Entry values immutable, readers keep handled signals blocked
  F->>F: Block, inspect pending and selection latch
  F->>R: Start under blocked calling mask
  R->>R: Check handlers and watching
  R->>C: Spawn with checked child entry state
  R->>F: Started, restore parent mask
  alt Parent restore fails
    F-->>R: Transition failure
    R->>C: Checked group/PID stop, pre-reap group stops
    R->>R: Nonblocking observation/reap, 2s absolute deadline
    alt Actual reap confirmed
      R->>F: Reaped once, identity released
    else Deadline or ECHILD
      R->>R: Retain uncertainty, disable released-ID signals
    end
    R->>R: Conditional foreground/mode recovery, no new lend
    R-->>F: Original transition error, first cancellation, all reports
  else Parent restore succeeds
    R->>C: Supervise job
    C-->>R: End or supervision error
    R-->>F: Ending or failure, first cancellation, all reports
  end
  F->>F: Cleanup resources with handlers present
  F->>F: Join pending/front/outcome/late facts
  Note over F,A: Selection failure joins here too, no reader becomes eligible
  F->>F: Checked final signal release
  Note over F: Only fully successful settlement permits exact result write
